{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫戀綜《女神配對計劃2》今日（24日）在商場宣傳，原有的5位女神何沛珈、郭珮文、俞可程、陳若思及阮嘉敏，聯同隱藏女神梁超怡與陳星妤，跟12位求愛勇者出席，場面熱鬧。</p><p>現場女神分別跟一位求愛勇者在限時內互動，男方要用盡辦法令女神心跳飆升。</p><p>&amp;l</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T11:02:25.831772+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T10:46:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T10:58:09.465551+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T10:58:09.465551+00:00","content_hash":"b2075007d26075b8e0bff4ecaee11d30296204de2f4027e09c3c360f1ef7d948","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}